    m_Localized: Display mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30050916913664082
    m_Localized: Fullscreen, borderless window or a normal window. Needs Apply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30050916913664083
    m_Localized: Resolution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30050916913664084
    m_Localized: The size of the game image. Needs Apply; it reverts by itself if
      you do not keep it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30050916913664085
    m_Localized: VSync
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30050916913664086
    m_Localized: Matches the frame rate to your screen to avoid tearing. Overrides
      the frame rate limit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30050916913664087
    m_Localized: Frame rate limit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30050916913664088
    m_Localized: The most frames per second the game will draw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30050916913664089
    m_Localized: Quality preset
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30050916913664090
    m_Localized: Overall graphics quality. Lower it if the game runs slowly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
